    ("SAFE-DISK-002", "Disk change must be safe for a running or self VM", "Detaching a disk, or moving an attached one, needs the VM stopped; hot-plug adds work only for SCSI, VirtIO and SATA; PyXie never takes disks from, or attaches them to, the VM it runs on.", "execution"),
