    ("SAFE-CT-001", "Container change must be valid", "A container change needs values in range, an existing device, room on the host for added memory, and nothing changed in Proxmox since the preview.", "execution"),
    ("SAFE-CREATE-001", "VM creation must be valid and fit the cluster", "A new VM needs a valid name and ID, a host that is online and not in maintenance, room for its memory and disks, an ISO that exists, a pool that exists, and must respect hard tag pins.", "execution"),
    ("SAFE-NIC-001", "Network device change must be valid and supported by the bridges", "A NIC needs a model Proxmox knows, a bridge that exists on the VM's host, a VLAN that bridge can carry, a unique MAC address, and it must change something. Other hosts lacking the bridge are warned about.", "execution"),
    ("SAFE-NIC-002", "Not PyXie's own network connection", "PyXie will not remove or re-point the network device of the VM it runs on: it would cut itself off mid-operation.", "execution"),
